.TH Num.sinh 3 2026-08-27 "Tomo man-pages"
.SH NAME
Num.sinh \- hyperbolic sine
.SH LIBRARY
Tomo Standard Library
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.BI Num.sinh\ :\ func(x:\ Num\ ->\ Num)
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
The hyperbolic sine of a number.


.SH ARGUMENTS

.TS
allbox;
lb lb lbx
l l l.
Name	Type	Description
x	Num	The number whose hyperbolic sine is to be computed. 
.TE
.SH RETURN
The hyperbolic sine of `x`.

.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
assert (0.).sinh() == 0
.EE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR Tomo-Num (3)
